3. Restrictions
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Except as expressly permitted in Section 2, You may not, and may not permit
anyone else to:

  (a) use the Software for, or as part of, a Competitive Offering, regardless
      of Your size;
  (b) distribute, sell, lease, lend or sublicense the Software other than
      embedded in Your App, or make it available so that it can be extracted,
      reused or consumed by third parties as an SDK;
  (c) reverse engineer, decompile or disassemble the Software, or attempt to
      derive its source code, except to the extent that applicable law
      expressly permits it notwithstanding this limitation;
  (d) modify, translate or create derivative works of the Software's binaries,
      other than as permitted in Section 2.4;
  (e) remove, alter or obscure any copyright, license, trademark or
      third-party notice in the Software; or
  (f) circumvent any technical measure in the Software that controls its use.

